/A 902 0 R
/Alt (Figure with five panels analyzing gene expression data. Panel A shows a volcano plot highlighting significantly upregulated and downregulated genes between normal and ulcer groups. Panel B presents a heatmap of gene expression with hierarchical clustering. Panel C features a dendrogram showing gene co-expression modules by color. Panel D displays a heatmap of module-trait relationships with correlation coefficients for normal and ulcer samples. Panel E illustrates a Venn diagram comparing overlapping and unique genes among three gene sets labeled GSE37265_diff, GSE37265_turquoise, and hPDLSCs.)
